  "solution": {
    "text": "According to the question,\r\n<img src=\"assets\\st0010_e51170c199f0.png\">\r\nTotal resistance of the given circuit\r\n$$\r\nR_{\\mathrm{eq}}=2 R\r\n$$\r\n$\\therefore \\quad I=\\frac{V / 2 R}{8} \\quad\\left(\\because I_{1}=V / 2 R\\right)$\r\nSo, current $I$ in the circuit $I=\\frac{V}{16 R} \\quad\\left(\\because I=\\frac{I_{1}}{8}\\right)$"
  }
